r to it. Every listed task in the file will be the first task on exactly one line, and no task is directly dependent on itself. This program first determines whether or not there are tasks that are mutually dependent. It will output the answer to that question. When no tasks are co-dependent, the program will then output a numbered list which sorts the tasks into a valid order. However, some .task files will contain mutual dependencies. If several tasks are dependent on each other (either directly or indirectly), then they must be done at the same time. In this case, some numbered items will be comma-separated lists.","topics":[],"score":2272,"global_rank":154530},{"name":"caojohnny/sched-temporal-test","owner":"caojohnny","html_url":"https://github.com/caojohnny/sched-temporal-test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Demo plugin used to determine the temporal order of tasks in the Bukkit scheduler relative to events called","topics":[],"score":2272,"global_rank":154536},{"name":"b20bharath/Music-Player-Android-Application-Client","owner":"b20bharath","html_url":"https://github.com/b20bharath/Music-Player-Android-Application-Client","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2272,"global_rank":154590},{"name":"b20bharath/Music-Player-Android-Application-Server","owner":"b20bharath","html_url":"https://github.com/b20bharath/Music-Player-Android-Application-Server","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2272,"global_rank":154591},{"name":"b20bharath/Vacation-Browser-Android-Application","owner":"b20bharath","html_url":"https://github.com/b20bharath/Vacation-Browser-Android-Application","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2272,"global_rank":154592},{"name":"b20bharath/GuessFour-Game-Android-Application","owner":"b20bharath","html_url":"https://gi